blocks.en:
∙ \bullet Dependency Planning. To make dependencies structural rather than incidental (Req-1), the dialogue is designed before any question is generated.
The planner samples keyframes across the video and produces a global dialogue plan with four components:
(i) a video synopsis summarizing characters, events, and settings;
(ii) dialogue guidelines specifying target content, capabilities to assess, and the number of turns;
(iii) a dependency graph assigning parent turns and edge types to each dependent turn;
and (iv) per-turn intents specifying the information to establish, the relevant video segment, and the information required from parent turns.
The plan guides subsequent generation under two constraints: dependencies must arise from recurring video content, and the planned turns must collectively cover the full video.
More planning details are provided in Appendix B .

blocks.zh:
* 联合依赖规划。 要使依赖性具有结构性,而不是偶然性(Req-1),在产生任何问题之前就设计了对话。
规划人员对录像中的关键框架进行了取样,并制定了全球对话计划,包括四个部分:
(一) 概述人物、事件和设置的视频概要;
(二) 规定目标内容、评估能力和回合次数的对话准则;
(三) 依赖图,指定每个依赖的转弯和边缘类型;
和(四)每回合的意向,具体说明要建立的信息,相关的视频段,以及要求父回合提供的信息.
该计划在两个制约因素下指导后生:依赖性必须来自反复出现的视频内容,计划中的转会必须集体覆盖整个视频.
附录B提供了更多的规划细节。

blocks.en:
Reviewers verify five aspects:
(1) answer correctness , whether the reference answer is supported by the video;
(2) temporal grounding , whether the annotated evidence intervals contain the required visual evidence;
(3) dependency validity , whether the annotated parent turns and dependency types match the question’s intended references;
(4) necessity , whether the question becomes unanswerable without its parent turns, even with access to the video and the remaining dialogue; and
(5) non-leakage , whether the question restates information that should instead be recalled from its parents.
For turns with multiple parents, reviewers additionally assess whether each parent contributes indispensable information.

blocks.zh:
审查者核实五个方面:
(1) 回答正确性,参考答案是否由视频支持;
(2) 时间定位,说明证据间隔是否包含必要的视觉证据;
(3) 依赖的有效性,说明的亲子关系和依赖类型是否与问题意图的参考相符;
( 四 ) 必要 、 问题 是否 在 父母 不 转 出 时 无法 回答 , 甚至在 视频 和 其余 对话 中 ;
(5) 非渗出,问题是否重复了应当从父母那里收回的信息。
对于有多个父母的轮班,审查人员还要评估每个父母是否都提供了不可或缺的信息。
